window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><strong><em>New York Times</em> bestselling author Lynsay Sands brings readers a Valentine’s Day tale with a bite.</strong></p><p>Mirabeau LaRouche knew she had a job to do, but she never expected her assignment to take her through New York City's dark, dank underground-in her bridesmaid gown, no less! And when her partner turns out to be mortal private investigator Tiny McGraw, Mireabeau knows it's no ordinary Cupid's arrow that has struck her heart this Valentine's Day.</p>"; 
